      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Checkpointed per turn — a killed worker resumes from the last checkpoint,\nnever from scratch. An in-flight external effect carries a write-ahead claim\nresolved on resume by probe or by a human decision — never by re-execution,\nnever by silent discard.",
